(1) Rabies control rules and regulations of the county;
(2) Rules and regulations for on-site sewage management systems of the county;
(3) Rules and regulations for water supply of the county;
(4) Rules and regulations pertaining to food service (adopted by the department of human resources and the county board of health and being chapter 290-5-14);
(5) Rules and regulations for public swimming pools, spas and natural beaches of the county; and
(6) Rules and regulations for tourist courts (adopted by the department of human resources and the county board of health and being chapter 290-5-18).
(Res. No. 93-003, § I, 7-6-1993)
